      <activity id="1791d5a0-88a5-53c1-8be0-cf00b1a2237f" activityNameId="003467c6-dda4-519d-bc80-ab5d1ae7e29f" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Operation, lorry 3.5-20t, fleet average</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Operation, lorry 3.5-20t, fleet average
Average data for the operation of an average Swiss lorry (fleet average) in the year 2005, comprising various emission technologies.;
UUID: de471a7d-71ef-3396-b2ca-91d4e687f82c
Fuel consumption is included. Direct airborne emissions of gaseous substances, particulate matters and heavy metals are accounted for. Particulate emissions comprise exhaust- and abrasions emissions.  Heavy metal emissions to soil and water caused by tyre abrision are included as well.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: diesel engine
Time period: undefined
Production volume: nachliefern
Sampling: Literature data. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_de471a7d-71ef-3396-b2ca-91d4e687f82c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
